<title>USA: MedQuist says it names John Emery CFO.</title>
<headline>MedQuist says it names John Emery CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MARLTON, N.J. 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>MedQuist Inc said on Tuesday that it has hired John Emery to be its vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Emery was previously chief financial officer of Integra LifeSciences Corp, said Medquist, a provider of electronic transcription services to the healthcare industry.</p>
<p>Last month, Medquist announced that its previous chief financial officer, Robert Graham, resigned to pusue a job as chief financial officer with an undisclosed emerging company.</p>
